{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Collapse is a new twist on a classic party game. Take turns to remove blocks from the tower while the camera spins. The more turns are taken, the more unstable the tower becomes and the faster the camera spins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Singleplayer and aim for the trophy scores, otherwise compete in VS Computer or Multiplayer 1v1 modes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer vs trophy high scores <strong>(NEW)</strong>, singleplayer vs PC <strong>(NEW)</strong>, or local multiplayer mode (2 player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes - classic mode and block push mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels to choose from: House, Beach, Monument, Museum and City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 alternate levels with different tower layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduced movement option, say goodbye to motion sickness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW:</strong> Character portraits! Choose your character - Octopus, Crab or Otter! Watch them react to gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW:</strong>\u00a0Steam Achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW:</strong> Improved music for all levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Octopus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3163210/9f234fb4f36d55c9b53b64812048645b8cfde2b7.jpg"},{"name":"Crab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3163210/1bd4c16f95404b27fd71af7c83623657648f69c8.jpg"},{"name":"Otter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3163210/8e447972d47586f5e000b31d7bef5ae66d33e6e6.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3163210?t=1763367396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3163210?t=1763367396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/a5941b7a17c46d818298214fff2fb4d3a2bbc20c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763367396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/a5941b7a17c46d818298214fff2fb4d3a2bbc20c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763367396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>TOWER COLLAPSE PLUS!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game update! A whole new bunch of features have been added since launch, come and check it out!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Collapse is a new twist on a classic party game. Take turns to remove blocks from the tower while the camera spins. The more turns are taken, the more unstable the tower becomes and the faster the camera spins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Singleplayer and aim for the trophy scores, otherwise compete in VS Computer or Multiplayer 1v1 modes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer vs trophy high scores <strong>(NEW)</strong>, singleplayer vs PC <strong>(NEW)</strong>, or local multiplayer mode (2 player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes - classic mode and block push mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels to choose from: House, Beach, Monument, Museum and City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 alternate levels with different tower layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduced movement option, say goodbye to motion sickness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW:</strong> Character portraits! Choose your character - Octopus, Crab or Otter! Watch them react to gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW:</strong>\u00a0Steam Achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW:</strong> Improved music for all levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Significant Otter Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163210/6a662f4c11d2e2ca56dfa3bf4dbcb2890556a244/header.jpg?t=1763367396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3163210/783310291/87324281497d4e8a09bca3008d1f917ba0b1714c/1763275973/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763292352","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3163210/783310291/87324281497d4e8a09bca3008d1f917ba0b1714c/1763275973/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763292352","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3163210/783310291/87324281497d4e8a09bca3008d1f917ba0b1714c/1763275973/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763292352","id":257232532,"name":"Tower Collapse - Free PLUS Update","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257232532/693c18a1c51216797147d2b25c0b2998e8263a04/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763292352"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3163210/738757/7d167c15427be70300d84dd9473b9a695efbc800/1750876630/dash_av1.mpd?t=1723751002","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3163210/738757/7d167c15427be70300d84dd9473b9a695efbc800/1750876630/dash_h264.mpd?t=1723751